owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T14:20:29Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T14:20:29Z","body":"I think it should probably be redrawn to fit within that new space by expanding its height. Act the same way as if you were to expand/shrink a `Label` with autowrap and no clipping before the max size feature.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4344600144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4344612553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651#issuecomment-4344612553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651","id":4344612553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAvWGyQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T14:22:11Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T14:22:11Z","body":"Is it doable? Won't it conflict with expanding the width?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4344612553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4344713599","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651#issuecomment-4344713599","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651","id":4344713599,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAvcRfw","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T14:35:10Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T14:35:10Z","body":"I'll have to see :)\r\nOtherwise, it will have to stay as is, and recommend using clipping. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4344713599/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4347185419","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651#issuecomment-4347185419","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651","id":4347185419,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAxzJCw","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T20:11:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T20:11:12Z","body":"You were correct in your assessment, KoBeWi; it's not really possible to make that work without causing a whole lot of other problems.\r\nWith a complete size system rewrite built from the ground up across all three systems (min, max, desired sizes), it would be relatively easy (built into the system from the get-go). The current size system is merely an augmented version of the old system, which was meant only to work with minimum sizes and used that minimum for `Label`. Some limitations do arise from it, including this, which should be removed at some point. But that's well beyond the scope of the PR. \r\n\r\nI'm not the biggest fan of this behavior being left in, but at the same time, if you are shrinking a `Label` (or its parent `Container`) without clipping enabled, well, it won't clip.\r\n\r\nSo yeah, my final assessment is that the behavior will be left in place due to technical reasons. It is better than the previous \"can't shrink at all\" behavior by quite a lot, as well, in my opinion. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4347185419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390497054","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651#issuecomment-4390497054","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651","id":4390497054,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBbGrHg","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T17:33:12Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T17:37:29Z","body":"I don't think it *is* a regression, since this only happens when you use a maximum size instead of the old minimum-size system. A limitation? Definitely. \r\nBut again, without clipping, the text will extend beyond the `Label`. That's existing behavior. Although it used to be impossible with autowrapping because of how autowrapping was forced to a given width. \r\n\r\nI do plan on properly addressing this limitation, but, as said, that requires a much more significant overhaul of the sizing system. Which I will do - hopefully in time for 4.8.\r\n\r\nI agree with the idea of opening an issue, and will do so once merged.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4390497054/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4399244938","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651#issuecomment-4399244938","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651","id":4399244938,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBjcmig","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"h